      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 35 · AI Contract Analyzer\nExtracts parties, dates, value and key clauses from contracts and highlights risky terms for legal review.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/contract-analyzer` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"contract_name\": \"Globex MSA\",\n \"text\": \"Paste contract text here...\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
